  (text "TRIG_LEVEL = 0.242 DAC_TRIG - 0.139 x 2.5 V\n(R383/R384/R385, Rpar 1.24k, 10 nF: 13 kHz)\nDAC 0.2..2.7 V -> -0.30..+0.31 V, 0.17 mV/LSB\n-2V5 sensitivity 0.139 V/V. TLV3801 Ib 2 uA\ntyp / 10 uA max x 1.24k = 2.5 / 12 mV (cal.)\nDAC load 6.7k. Reset (PA4 high-Z): -0.34 V." (at 12.7 80.01 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 107dc76c-08b3-5088-b7d9-f0f78cb2f065))
