  (text "END TERMINATIONS 0402 to GND\n(L2 via at the pad): line 49.9 R,\nPSTRB_A/K 43 R (loaded 41.3 R)" (at 375.92 208.28 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid ac12ca61-5670-5607-8df6-0e773a1a9de6))
  (text "COS3502 (U305-U312) on +3V3/GND, 100 nF X7R at each pin 8. Pinout NOT TLV3502: 1 +INA, 2 -INA,\n3 +INB, 4 -INB, 5 V-, 6 OUTB, 7 OUTA, 8 V+ (Cosine datasheet rev 1.0). Tap 2p -> unit A, 2p+1 -> B." (at 53.34 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9f0f2272-5a4a-5534-a185-4e05f2700f7f))
  (hierarchical_label "VTAP_TH" (shape input) (at 242.57 248.92 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid 31817a23-e511-56bc-88f4-9ae25c9a699a))
  (label "VTH1" (at 262.89 248.92 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 77a033cd-3964-5130-81b0-dd51c5578535))
  (label "VTH2" (at 262.89 264.16 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b5007919-28f6-5adf-b6a7-9c5c1281e910))
  (text "VTH1: taps 0-7, VTH2: taps 8-15\nVTAP_TH 0..+80 mV (+17 mV, phase_array)" (at 190.5 279.4 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 5320d431-4576-5083-a412-c47449a645c5))
  (hierarchical_label "VTAP_P" (shape input) (at 271.78 236.22 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid 385da021-99c2-565f-b958-dee7af45a242))
  (label "VTAP_P" (at 287.02 236.22 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid b2d831b2-5fd6-5a38-a84a-7165a555b399))
  (hierarchical_label "VTAP_N" (shape input) (at 271.78 254 180) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify right)) (uuid df3af59c-1251-59f8-ab16-ad0679a9af0c))
  (label "VTAP_N" (at 287.02 254 0) (fields_autoplaced) (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left bottom)) (uuid 64233463-4c3d-5ddf-a293-9da611e1e25b))
  (text "VTAP_P/N = +/-2.5 V\n12.5 mA each" (at 269.24 274.32 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid a6e2d45c-b676-5f9f-872b-932c486b445d))
  (text "TRIGGER (sim/phase/RESULT.md (f)): TMUX136 on local -0.9 V ground, VCC +2V5.\nA1 = BUF_OUT_T (signal, high-Z end of the 50 R line), B1 = EXT_CLK (SMA on the input sheet,\n49.9 R here at U301.3). Signal +/-0.5 V = 0.4..1.4 V above switch GND. Ron unspecified there." (at 12.7 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 9076b928-5b71-5fe4-b8c8-988404258315))
  (text "TLV3801: +/-2V5, GND pin to GND, LVDS-type out.\n100 R R3xx across OUT+/OUT- at the pins\n(350 mV VOD, 25 R per leg at HF). Trace to\nTRF/LVDS2 short (< 5 mm, ~30 ps)." (at 99.06 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid a7defb11-7c91-5585-bbb3-07c960418c2e))
  (text "LINE DRIVER: TRF37D73 22 dB, 50 R in/out. Bias: bead on\nthe line + 47 uH || 1 k (tau 1.9 us), own 100 nF.\n12 dB pad 82/91/82: line +/-0.21 V (data),\n0.42 V steps; 10-90 % 225-250 ps at the taps." (at 218.44 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid a2aff7a8-e863-5fff-96b9-71ee8c6663c7))
  (text "COARSE: 2 x 470 R bridge (high-Z tap,\nTRF input drop < 5 %). SN65LVDS2 at 3V3\n-> FPGA pin 27 (GCLKT_3). Good to ~100-150 MHz edges." (at 187.96 91.44 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid a8988e2f-a241-59f8-a5b4-46109b8944ff))
  (text "DELAY LINE (SPEC decision 4, co-propagating): signal line 75 ps per tap (0.26 mm / 59 R trace, meander\n9.929 mm between taps, loaded to ~50 R by each gate ~0.37 pF); strobe lines PSTRB_A/K 40 ps per tap\n(0.16 mm / 72.8 R trace, 4.514 mm pitch, loaded); effective tap spacing 75 - 40 = 35 ps, 16 taps = 560 ps window.\nGate: BAT15-04W pin 3 on the line (stub < 0.3 mm), 0.47 pF C0G hold caps to PSTRB_A (anode)\n/ PSTRB_K (cathode). Strobe >= 2.75 V per side with the 80 ps launch stub (~4 V launch), FWHM 220-320 ps.\nphase_array RESULT: line measured 75.7 ps/tap with a 70 ps design -> layout draws 70 ps for 75 ps." (at 294.64 33.02 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 105f6a68-f20b-5155-8e80-62ae3f0ddef8))
  (text "READOUT: 2.2 k to VTAP_N (A node) / VTAP_P (K node),\n2 x 1 k summing to COS3502 IN+, IN- = VTH (VTAP_TH).\nHold nodes and the 1 k < 2 mm from the diode; comparator\nnext to its gate. Rising edges only, VTAP_TH ~ +17 mV.\nFPGA samples TAP[15:0] at strobe + 12 ns (10-22 ns); 50 % duty OK\n(reverse pulse < 0.5 mV; 70 % optional)." (at 294.64 68.58 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 102cd584-8316-5652-8069-202638920a44))
  (text "line 75 ps/tap" (at 74.93 125.73 0) (effects (font (size 1 1)) (justify left top)) (uuid 77aebb64-8ac0-5dbb-8132-caeac8cb9ced))
